WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
If you take blood pressure or other heart medications, this one is important.

2
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.520
If you normally take your blood pressure medication in the morning,

3
00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.080
please take it with a small sip of water.

4
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.360
However, please confirm this with your doctor's office in advance,

5
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.840
as recommendations can vary depending on your specific medication.

6
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.000
Do not skip your blood pressure medication without checking with them first.

7
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.800
Keeping your blood pressure stable during the procedure

8
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.240
is important for your safety and your doctor wants to make sure you're set up

9
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.420
well before you arrive.
